Data inside the wheel
---------------------

hydromodpy/spatial/administrative/departement.gpkg
  Outlines of the French departments, from IGN ADMIN EXPRESS COG CARTO.
  Licence Ouverte / Etalab 2.0. Attribution: IGN.

hydromodpy/results/zarr_store/data/cf_standard_names_v85.txt
  A curated subset of the CF Standard Name Table v85,
  https://cfconventions.org/. It is used under the terms of the CF
  Conventions, which allow free use with attribution.

Data that HydroModPy downloads, and never ships
-----------------------------------------------

The package downloads these on request. Each file keeps the licence of its
provider, and HydroModPy writes it in the sidecar of the file.

  BD Topage, Hub'Eau, SIM2 (Meteo-France), BD TOPO and BD ALTI (IGN),
  BRGM geology maps: Licence Ouverte / Etalab 2.0.
  OpenStreetMap: Open Database Licence (c) OpenStreetMap contributors.
  EU-Hydro: Copernicus data policy, free use with attribution.

The solver binaries (MODFLOW 6, MODFLOW-NWT, MODPATH, MT3D-USGS) come from
the USGS, are public domain, and are downloaded on first use.
